# Raspberry Pi firmware/kernel input for the native boot-filesystem builder.
#
# The tag and exact commit name one official raspberrypi/firmware snapshot.
# Critical boot binaries and both copied trees are hashed again after checkout;
# a mutable tag, corrupt cache, partial checkout, or wrong kernel/module pair
# therefore fails before an install artifact is produced.

